VDR Plugin 'vdrsternelec' Revision History
-------------------------------------------

2026-10-21: Version 0.2.0

- New source type "dir": a local or mounted network directory containing
  update files (.tar, .img.gz) and checksums (<file>.sha256 or SHA256SUMS).
  This is the "manual update" known from LibreELEC, with checksum
  verification and selection in the OSD.
- SHA256SUMS checksum lists are also supported for HTTP directory listings.
- A checksum list must contain an entry for the update file.

2026-10-21: Version 0.1.0

- Initial revision.
- Release sources: LibreELEC style releases.json, GitHub releases and plain
  HTTP directory listings.
- Download into /storage/.update with SHA-256 verification.
- OSD menus, setup page and SVDRP commands.
- Automatic check, notification, download and reboot when idle.
